                <pb facs="0667" n="581" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg581"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Combs to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic">March 23,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Combs reports that the Government of Guatemala, in maintaining its
                    constitution, refuses to recognize the American citizenship of Alberto, Posadas,
                    a native-born Guatemalan returning bearing a United States passport, and that
                    the naturalized citizen referred to is under detention for refusal to pay a
                    forced loan.</p>
                <p>Mr. Combs requests instructions.)</p>
            </div>
